---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="Privacy policy for Tenuta Montincello."
	lastUpdated="19 July 2026"
	currentPage="privacy-policy"
>
	<p>
		Tenuta Montincello di Disanti Anna Maria ("Data Controller") collects and processes the
		personal data of users of this website, in particular the data provided through the quote
		request form (name, email, phone number and message content).
	</p>

	<h2>Data Controller</h2>
	<p>
		Tenuta Montincello di Disanti Anna Maria<br />
		Contrada Montincello 20A, 71019, Vieste (FG), Italy<br />
		Email: <a href="mailto:tenumont@gmail.com">tenumont@gmail.com</a>
	</p>

	<h2>Data collected</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Identification data voluntarily provided (first name, last name)</li>
		<li>Contact data (email, phone number)</li>
		<li>Content of the request sent via the contact form</li>
		<li>Browsing data automatically collected by the server (IP address, browser type)</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Purpose of processing</h2>
	<p>
		Data is processed exclusively to respond to information and quote requests submitted by
		users, to manage bookings, and to comply with legal obligations related to the
		accommodation business.
	</p>

	<h2>Processing methods and legal basis</h2>
	<p>
		Processing is carried out using IT tools, with logic strictly related to the stated
		purposes, and in a way that ensures the security and confidentiality of the data. The legal
		basis is the user's consent to submitting the request and the performance of
		pre-contractual/contractual measures related to the booking.
	</p>

	<h2>Data sharing and disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		Data is not disclosed and is not shared with third parties, except as necessary to submit
		the request form through the form management service provider (Formspree) and in cases
		required by law.
	</p>

	<h2>Data subject rights</h2>
	<p>
		At any time, users may exercise the rights provided for under Articles 15-22 of EU
		Regulation 2016/679 (GDPR), including access, rectification, erasure and objection to the
		processing of their data, by writing to
		<a href="mailto:tenumont@gmail.com">tenumont@gmail.com</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
